{"type":"item.started","item":{"id":"item_39","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -lc \"cat >> agent/journal.md <<'EOF'\n\n## Iteration 2 — adaptive variance and tails (pre-registered)\nHypothesis: recent volatility is more informative than a flat seven-day mean, particularly at 1h. Student innovations or a shared random volatility scale may also improve CRPS by avoiding excessive central dispersion while retaining tails.\nChange: compare constant-grid, seasonal, adaptive (6h/24h half-life; 75% recent weight), faster adaptive, adaptive scale 0.85, Student t5, and lognormal path-scale mixture 0.4. Same 1000 paths and seed, all 13 assets, 6h prompt grid. Freeze seasonality fit at July 31. Development windows August 1–7 and August 17–23. These windows are chosen ahead of observing their scores, rather than asserting they are opposite regimes without evidence.\nKill threshold: no configuration-wide promotion on a regression in both windows; retain parsimonious alternatives within 0.5% pending denser evaluation. No ranks are produced.\nResult / Verdict: pending.\nEOF\ncat > agent/run_grid.py <<'PY'\nimport concurrent.futures\nimport os\nfrom pathlib import Path\nimport subprocess\n\njobs=[]\nvariants={\n'constant':{'MODEL_MODE':'constant'},\n'seasonal':{'MODEL_MODE':'seasonal'},\n'adaptive':{'MODEL_MODE':'adaptive'},\n'fast':{'MODEL_MODE':'adaptive_fast'},\n'adaptive085':{'MODEL_MODE':'adaptive','MODEL_SCALE':'.85'},\n'adaptive_t5':{'MODEL_MODE':'adaptive','MODEL_TAIL':'5'},\n'adaptive_mix4':{'MODEL_MODE':'adaptive','MODEL_MIX':'.4'},\n}\nfor window,start,end in [('aug1','2026-08-01','2026-08-08'),('aug2','2026-08-17','2026-08-24')]:\n for name,env in variants.items():\n  tag=name+'_'+window\n  # Already running/completed initial jobs.\n  if tag in ['seasonal_aug1','adaptive_aug1']:continue\n  jobs.append((tag,start,end,env))\ndef run(job):\n tag,start,end,extra=job\n budget=Path('agent/BUDGET.md').read_text()\n if 'LANDING ORDER' in budget:return tag,'landing'\n env=os.environ.copy();env.update(extra);env['OPENBLAS_NUM_THREADS']='1'\n with open('agent/results_'+tag+'.log','w') as log:\n  p=subprocess.run(['uv','run','agent/predict.py','--research','--model','agent/modeling.py','--tag',tag,'--start',start,'--end',end],env=env,stdout=log,stderr=subprocess.STDOUT)\n return tag,p.returncode\nwith concurrent.futures.ThreadPoolExecutor(max_workers=3) as pool:\n for result in pool.map(run,jobs):print(result,flush=True)\nPY\nuv run agent/run_grid.py > agent/grid.log 2>&1\"","aggregated_output":"","exit_code":null,"status":"in_progress"}}
