{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_92","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -lc \"cat >> agent/journal.md <<'EOF'\n\n## Iteration 7 — combine validated components (pre-registered)\nHypothesis: refitting HAR under robust 30-minute seasonal normalization will preserve the useful learned mean reversion while improving commodity/equity session calibration.\nChange: refit all HAR coefficients with the 48-bin absolute-return seasonal profile (training still ends July 31). Compare Gaussian mixtures0.4, mixture0.4 plus unit-variance t5 innovations, and modest ±10% scale variants. A separate MA(1) branch is retained only for crypto1h, where it improved both initial windows by ~0.04–0.08% and needs seed confirmation.\nKill threshold: combined model must beat the original HAR mixture on both windows for its configuration. Small differences will require denser prompts and multiple seeds rather than choosing the best single draw.\nResult / Verdict: pending.\nEOF\ncp agent/run_grid.py agent/run_combined.py\nuv run python - <<'PY'\np='agent/run_combined.py';s=open(p).read();a=s.index('variants={');b=s.index('\\\\nfor window',a)\ns=s[:a]+'''variants={\n'har48':{'MODEL_MODE':'har','MODEL_MIX':'.4','SEASON_FILE':'seasonality_abs48.json','HAR_FILE':'har_abs48.json'},\n'har48_t5':{'MODEL_MODE':'har','MODEL_MIX':'.4','MODEL_TAIL':'5','SEASON_FILE':'seasonality_abs48.json','HAR_FILE':'har_abs48.json'},\n'har48_09':{'MODEL_MODE':'har','MODEL_MIX':'.4','MODEL_SCALE':'.9','SEASON_FILE':'seasonality_abs48.json','HAR_FILE':'har_abs48.json'},\n'har48_11':{'MODEL_MODE':'har','MODEL_MIX':'.4','MODEL_SCALE':'1.1','SEASON_FILE':'seasonality_abs48.json','HAR_FILE':'har_abs48.json'},\n}'''+s[b:];open(p,'w').write(s)\nPY\nuv run agent/run_combined.py > agent/combined.log 2>&1\"","aggregated_output":"","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
