{"type":"item.started","item":{"id":"item_234","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -lc \"cat >> agent/report.md <<'EOF'\n\n### September confirmation update\nThe ten-day September4–13 confirmation uses80 prompts per asset/format at1000 paths. At identical98.8718% mean realized coverage, the starter scores1920.4177 /3561.5627 /853.3771 (COM /crypto24 /crypto1 current-rule replay). The August31-refitted candidate scores1646.3891 /3399.9605 /805.9141. Every asset-format improves. Refreshing from July31 improves COM modestly but slightly worsens crypto; the older checkpoint scores1651.0233 /3389.2857 /803.8759. That is evidence for the basic model, not a claim that more recent fitting always helps.\n\nAdditional tests of fitted drift, tree models, a bounded neural residual ensemble, range/volume features, empirical innovations, residual blocks, volatility term structure and direct training-week CRPS calibration did not meet their prespecified out-of-sample promotion thresholds. The GPU experiment was completed rather than assumed inferior. The stable improvements come from seasonal scale calibration and modest uncertainty in future scale.\n\nFull orchestration using exact validator prompts is now also being replayed from a locally recovered historical score/reward bundle. Completed assets have100% realized coverage and confirm the CRPS improvement. Final full-configuration results will replace this progress note once replay completes.\nEOF\ncat agent/BUDGET.md && tail -5 agent/cache_pages_last.log && cat agent/full_campaign_remaining.log\"","aggregated_output":"","exit_code":null,"status":"in_progress"}}
