e': 1633.6612377790445, 'candidate': 1401.657590979322}\nCRYPTO_1H coefficient-weighted {'baseline': 757.940703132665, 'candidate': 662.620774935752}\nCRYPTO_24H coefficient-weighted {'baseline': 3616.3607466452495, 'candidate': 3485.8993578654554}\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
